# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large build artifacts and debug dumps that are NOT inputs to any image.
#
# Why this block exists (measured 2026-08-19): apps/api/Dockerfile ends in
# `COPY . .`, which was producing an 835 MB layer and a 3.67 GB image. On every
# api deploy that cost ~214s to COPY, ~420s to export and ~242s to unpack —
# roughly 15 minutes of a 27-minute deploy — and it made every `docker create`
# and `docker rm` in the blue/green rollout slow as well. None of the paths
# below are read by any service at runtime.
#
# ⛔ Patterns here are DELIBERATELY exact, not globs. `release` as a bare
# pattern would also exclude scripts/release/, which holds the deploy wrappers.
# ⛔ Do NOT add `docs` — apps/api reads docs/agent-knowledge out of its own
# image at boot (agentKnowledgeSync.ts); excluding it silently empties the
# assistant's knowledge documents.

# Electron installer output (~635 MB of .exe). Untracked build leftovers that
# happened to be sitting in the server clone; the published installers live in
# /opt/connectcomms/downloads, never in the repo.
apps/desktop/release

# Committed Asterisk/PBX trace dumps (~87 MB). Referenced by nothing in the tree.
trace*.txt

# Agent worktrees checked out inside the repo.
.claude
